// 欢迎加入kvspace世界
lib kvlang/spec/附录/控制流 {
	r##"# 控制流（仅限 rwfunc 体内）

```
if_stmt     = "if" "(" expr ")" "{" { statement } "}"
              { "else" "if" "(" expr ")" "{" { statement } "}" }
              [ "else" "{" { statement } "}" ]

while_stmt  = "while" "(" expr ")" "{" { statement } "}"

for_stmt    = "for" "(" ident "in" expr ")" "{" { statement } "}"

block_stmt    = ident ":" "{" { statement } "}"    (* 具名作用域 *)

break_stmt    = "break"
continue_stmt = "continue"
return_stmt   = "return"    (* 无返回值；输出通过写参传递 *)
```

以上为**源语法**。layout 将其展平为线性 irseq `[1,0]…[N,0]`，控制流降级为 layout 产物 `goto(irseq)`
/ `br(cond, irseq, irseq)`（目标解析为整数 irseq，标签另存 `/lib/<func>/‥labels/<name>`）——`goto`/
`br` 非源语法，见 layout 语义卷。
"## -> /lib/kvlang/spec/附录/控制流
}
